window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I can't escape this academy...</b></p> <p>My name is Lexi Cameron, and I really need some help in the form of two sexy demons, a wayward alpha's son, and an angel who is worse than the fallen. </p> <p>The only (tiny) problem? </p> <p>They'd rather kill me than help me get out of here. </p> <p>Welcome to Demon Academy where the new students might do more than just trying to kill you. They might give your soul to hell and smile as they wave you goodbye. Funny enough, I think mine belongs there, anyway. That is, if Lucifer has anything to do with it.... </p> <p><b>Please note: </b>This is as reverse harem dark academy romance suitable for listeners 18 and above.</p>"; 
